/**
 * M11b Lane S (P5.2) — the worker's SSE endpoints, memory mode (no `POSTGRES_URL`/`DATABASE_URL`).
 *
 * `stream_seq` is not yet assigned by any enqueue statement (that splice is fenced off from this
 * lane until `ai/m11-2-handoff/b1-fixes-landed.md` exists), so fixtures stamp it directly onto the
 * memory-mode wakeup row — the same "insert a wakeup row with a stream_seq via a test-only helper"
 * seam the lane brief calls for.
